        {
          "id": "37d087fa-968b-3b0a-b0ec-96fe7d79f4fc",
          "content": {
            "id": "37d087fa-968b-3b0a-b0ec-96fe7d79f4fc",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Neuronetics (STIM): Losses Worsen Despite Revenue Growth Outpacing Market Narrative",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Neuronetics (STIM) remains unprofitable, with losses having widened at an average rate of 10.3% per year over the past five years. Its net profit margin has yet to show signs of improvement. Looking forward, the company is expected to stay unprofitable through the next three years, but revenue is forecast to grow 12.1% annually, outpacing the broader US market's outlook of 10.5% per year. See our full analysis for Neuronetics. Now, let's put these latest numbers into context by comparing...",
